==living_room==
Gary and Issac are going on their first date. Gary wants to find a great place to take 
Issac to impress him, but doesn't know what Issac likes. Where should they go?

There are four different places to choice from.

 + [Take Issac to the bowling alley]->bowling_alley
 + [Take Issac to dancing] ->dancing
 + [Take Issac to karaokee]->karaokee
 + [Take Issac on a picnic] ->picnic


== bowling_alley ==
Gary and Issac end up at the bowling alley. It seemed like fun at first, but then it start getting to loud and crowded, also Issac hurt his hand lifting the ball. Issac looked like he had fun, but I don't think he wants to have a second date.
    +[Start Over] -> living_room
    
    
    
    ==dancing==
    Gary and Issac go dancing. It was tons of fun! The 2 seemed to have had a wonderful time dancing together and Issac looks super happy to go on a second date!
    ->END
    +[Start over]->living_room
